+// rows take n_ff 640 only): 8 lanes a row, 6 of them 3 blocks each (n_ff / 384 groups of 3), 4 rows a warp; the group's
+// entries' q8_1 rows staged in shared memory once a block, each lane's weights read once for all of them. The sums are
